  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Campfed Marginalialized girls complete secondary edu. and improve learni</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objective is that marginalized girls in rural Ghana, Malwai, Tanzania, Zambia and Zimbabwe are erolled and complete secondary school and achieve improved learning outcome. The project will focus on individual support to girls, improved learning environments, strengthened community capacity to support girls education and adoption of best practice in Ministiresof Education at national and district levels.</narrative>
  </description>
